mapping "YAA.76.ZZ.1" source="YAA.76.ZZ" target="SNOMED_CT:160729004" relationship=related_to {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source YAA.76.ZZ SNOMED CT 160729004 = needs-tested (a specific Swedish elder housing form:
        congregate/senior housing with shared common spaces and light support, allocated on a
        needs-tested basis as a SoL intervention). Target (finding, sv synonym). Why this target:
        sheltered housing is the closest international concept (congregate housing with support for
